{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/562289-rv-drones-and-combat","id":562289,"title":"RV Drones and Combat","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-20T16:05:52-07:00","id":562289,"title":"RV Drones and Combat","content":"I have a guy in my group that has a pretty solid idea that I like. He wants to be in Network 0. His idea is using remote RV drones in game. They make some really solid ones now that are affordable. Like there is a 4 bladed helicopter one at Verizon that is controlled by a cellphone an has live camera feed that also records for 300 bucks. He has some YouTube videos of a guy modding one with a gun on it. <br /> <br /> How would that work in game? What skills control the functions such as flying the drone and targeting.<br /> <br /> Are merits needed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6541-kingbellos","name":"KingBellos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T16:39:50-07:00","id":562344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KingBellos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/562289-rv-drones-and-combat#post562289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a guy in my group that has a pretty solid idea that I like. He wants to be in Network 0. His idea is using remote RV drones in game. They make some really solid ones now that are affordable. Like there is a 4 bladed helicopter one at Verizon that is controlled by a cellphone an has live camera feed that also records for 300 bucks. He has some YouTube videos of a guy modding one with a gun on it.<br /> <br /> How would that work in game? What skills control the functions such as flying the drone and targeting.<br /> <br /> Are merits needed?</div> </div> </div> </div>This will hopefully be added into the next Hunter or Hurt Locker but for the meantime, I would just run with a simple Drive skill with drone as the spec. <br /> <br /> However I would start slapping negative modifiers to the rolls based on distance, if the signal can go through the material, and if the drone isn't FPV and is operating out of sight.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}